) &= (30 + 5) \\\\\n-50a &= 35\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $b$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}6}$, and add the equations*."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186508307 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186192655 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3e7bfcbe-4913-53e0-98c7-171965adfe62" :knowledge-point/title "Eliminating the Second Variable" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050190 :topic/title "Solving Systems of Linear Equations Using Elimination: One Transformation"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04417b27-9946-5125-9466-90e0f7a986c9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "first" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508243} {:answer/id #uuid "3e2838d9-13e8-537e-97ea-602c03007640" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "second" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508279}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "04417b27-9946-5125-9466-90e0f7a986c9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "first" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508243} :answer-field/id #uuid "2d9ddd9b-417d-5c44-844c-4b4a797676c0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508270} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19fa65bd-e0ac-53c5-ad03-2a4fda5a68fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508259} {:answer/id #uuid "52fa9519-a033-5b42-9165-65290877079d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "15" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508293} {:answer/id #uuid "616b773c-eb7f-53d8-8033-ae2212b1eda3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :ans