oro]{\\color{blue}2}$, and add the equations*."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186508360 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186192655 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3e7bfcbe-4913-53e0-98c7-171965adfe62" :knowledge-point/title "Eliminating the Second Variable" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050190 :topic/title "Solving Systems of Linear Equations Using Elimination: One Transformation"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "225d1f98-8b27-555d-afa6-e6d941ada34c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508264} {:answer/id #uuid "dc1678d3-65a7-531d-aee9-ccee73215a8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508356} {:answer/id #uuid "dfcb8d2b-1f63-5290-bbaf-e02572a87ce1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508357} {:answer/id #uuid "e7a4499a-ae96-5717-b6b6-6daef56eb4cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508366}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "225d1f98-8b27-555d-afa6-e6d941ada34c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508264} :answer-field/id #uuid "07170df4-3002-5d99-8a83-98dd811ef120" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508245} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "21b689ce-4bcb-548c-8656-608257bc0e48" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "first" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508262} {:answer/id #uuid "57d446a3-0af8-50b0-b18a-e196585ca47d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "second" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508299}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "21b689ce-4bcb-548c-8656-608257bc0e48" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "first" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508262} :answer-field/id #uuid "4e9670cb-e167-5a08-925c-656947a40567" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508288}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e241fcce-6c28-5eb1-91b2-aee856170291" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}10a + b &=-1 \\\\ 9a + 5b &=-5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\nDescribe the steps needed to eliminate the variable $b$ from the system:\nUse an integer multiplier and leave the other equation unchanged.\n\nTo eliminate $b$, multiply the\n{{field-1}}\nequation by\n{{field-2}},\nand add the equations." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the coefficient of $b$ in the first equation is $1$, while in the second equation it is $5$.\n\nIf we multiply the first equation by ${\\color{blue}-5}$, then the coefficient of $b$ will turn into $-5$, which will cancel with the coefficient of $5$ in the second equation.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}&(10a + b = -1)\\cdot (-5) \\\\ &9a + 5b = -5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, when we add the two equations, the variable $b$ will be eliminated:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n-50a - 5b &= 5 \\\\\n9a + 5b &= -5 \\\\\n(-50a + 9a) &= (5 - 5) \\\\\n-41a &= 0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $b$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}-5}$, and add the equations*."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186508365 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186192655 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3e7bfcbe-4913-53e0-98c7-171965adfe62" :knowledge-point/title "Eliminating the Se